{
  "id": "uncertainty-avoidance",
  "term": "uncertainty avoidance",
  "definition": "Uncertainty avoidance is a cultural tendency at the group or national level to be uncomfortable with ambiguity and uncertain situations. In this sense, it describes a shared aversion to ambiguity that can shape behavior and reinforce preference for familiar options or the status quo.",
